Subject: [PATCH v2 1/3] jails/instances/lab-claude: Let claude install
 packages from ports
To: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Cc: lab-devel@p7x.dev
Change-Id: ptlktkozlrrvyvlnmyookpvsluxknwmx

The agent sometimes needs a tool the jail does not have, and its only
option was to stop and ask for a rebuild. That stalls the work for a
dependency that FreeBSD-ports could have supplied in seconds.

claude may now install packages from FreeBSD-ports as root through
doas. doas matches arguments exactly, so it cannot permit "pkg
install" with any package names but nothing else; a small root-owned
script that only installs from FreeBSD-ports is the one command doas
allows. claude still cannot remove packages, change repositories, or
install into another root.
